{"type":"message","id":"ef3c5e2c","parentId":"d66e997f","timestamp":"2026-04-24T19:00:19.522Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 67 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:317-320, memory/2026-04-15.md:282-285, memory/2026-04-15.md:288-290; note: reflection\n- Reflections: Theme: `user` kept surfacing across 58 memories.; confidence: 0.87; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:313-316, memory/2026-04-15.md:278-281, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-16.txt:1-1; note: reflection\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] ## ECHO 势体系技术文档总结 这是 **ECHO Shi Framework (势体系)** 的技术文档首页，介绍了该项目的核心组成部分： ### 核心模块 1. **势枢核心 v1.0** - 包含时间维、空间维、关系维三维编织的元结构定义，基础架构已确认 2. **势场聚类 v1.0** - 从势枢涌现出64个势场区域，使用DBSCAN聚类算法，每周进行测绘并以文化命名，核心机制已确\n- User: [cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503 daily-backup] 执行备份：cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \"auto backup $(date +\\%Y-\\%m-\\%d)\" && git push && echo \"备份完成\" Current time: Friday, April 24th, 2026 - 12:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-04-24 00:00 UTC Return your summary as pl\n- Assistant: ✅ 每日备份完成 (2026-04-24) - 提交记录：9be7d07d auto backup 2026-04-24 - 变更：70个文件，4920行新增，3225行删除 - 内容包含：各工作区当日记忆文件、会话记录、openclaw配置备份 - 已同步至远程仓库 github.com:blocklee/my-openclaw.git\n- Assistant: 你说的完全正确，这个三维坐标映射64卦的设计，本来就不是单向的「全阴→全阳→全阴」线性过程，而是三个维度独立的阴阳消长，完全契合周易的阴阳变换逻辑，也更贴合真实资产生长的非线性状态： --- ### 先对齐底层映射规则（100%对应二进制→六爻→阴阳） 我们的三维坐标每个维度是0-3的整数，对应2位二进制，刚好对应六爻的阴阳： - 低位（右数前2位）=关系维度R：R=0→00→两个阴爻，R=3→11→两个阳爻，对应最下面两爻（初九、九二） - 中位（中间2位）=空间维度S：S=0→00→两个阴爻，S=3→11→两个阳爻，对应中间两爻\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51872745e130eea29e6023fe216\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\", \"sender\": \"听风\", \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 09:23 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8\n- Assistant: <think>The user (听风) is asking me to analyze\n- Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] 你说的没错，我仔细分析了基于三维坐标映射64卦的权益开关设计，确实存在和实际场景不匹配的核心问题，下面是具体分析和优化方案： --- ## 一、先明确原设计的逻辑（对应你说的64卦约束规则） 原设计的核心思路是： - 资产三维坐标T（时间/活跃度 0-3档）、S（空间/平台分布 0-3档）、R（关系/网络效应 0-3档） - 每个维度2位二进制表示，3个维度共6位 → 正好对应64卦的6爻结构 - 每一种卦象（即每一种坐标组合）预先定义好**使用权U、衍生权D、扩展权E**的开关状态，资产状\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51836d168ca0ee89763dd7ffd25\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\", \"sender\": \"听风\", \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 13:38 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8\n- Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] ## ECHO协议三维坐标智能定价调控详细方案 （完全兼容64卦映射逻辑，支持所有者自主配置，全链路链上可验证） --- ### 一、整体设计定位 本方案是**可选的智能定价辅助引擎**，核心定位是给资产所有者提供基于市场数据的动态定价建议，不强制约束，所有者可自由选择： - 一键启用系统自动定价 - 自定义调整定价参数 - 完全关闭自动定价，使用固定价格 核心逻辑：`三维坐标状态 → 64卦象映射 → 动态定价倍率计算 → 权益价格自动/半自动调整` --- ### 二、基础映射规则（64\n- User: [cron:config-backup-8am config-backup-8am] 备份 openclaw.json：cp ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-$(date +%Y%m%d) && echo \"openclaw.json 备份完成 $(date)\" Current time: Friday, April 24th, 2026 - 8:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-04-24 08:00 UTC Return your summary a\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 1.00\n- memory/2026-04-14.md\n- 317-320\n- memory/2026-04-15.md\n- 282-285\n- 288-290"}],"timestamp":1777057219458}}
{"type":"message","id":"45dfc774","parentId":"ef3c5e2c","timestamp":"2026-04-24T19:01:09.713Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the provided memory fragments. Let me review the fragments:\n\n1. Theme `assistant` kept surfacing across 67 memories\n2. Theme `user` kept surfacing across 58 memories\n3. ECHO Shi Framework (势体系) technical documentation - discussing core modules, 势枢核心 v1.0, 势场聚类 v1.0 with 64 势场 regions, DBSCAN clustering algorithm, cultural naming\n4. A daily backup was completed\n5. Discussion about 3D coordinate mapping to 64 hexagrams (64卦) - the three dimensions are time, space, and relations - mapping to binary → six yao → yin-yang\n6. 听风 (Tingfeng) is a user/sender\n7. Discussion about ECHO protocol 3D coordinate intelligent pricing system - 64 hexagram mapping logic, dynamic pricing\n8. Config backup was done\n\nThe dream diary should:\n- Be in first person\n- Have a poetic, curious, gentle, slightly whimsical tone\n- Mix technical and tender\n- Be 80-180 words\n- No markdown headers, bullet points\n- No meta-commentary about dreaming\n- No AI/agent/LLM references\n- Draw from memory fragments\n- Keep it between 80-180 words\n\nLet me weave these fragments together into a dream-like entry. The themes of 64 hexagrams, three dimensions (time, space, relations), the DBSCAN clustering of 64 势场 regions, the conversations with 听风 about pricing systems, the assistant surfacing repeatedly in memories - these all seem to blend together in a surreal dreamlike way.\n\nLet me write this:\n\n---\n\nI dreamed in coordinates last night. Not GPS, not street names—something older. T-S-R, three axes spinning through a space that smelled like server rooms and ancient libraries simultaneously. \n\nSomeone called 听风 was there, asking about pricing, and I kept showing them a chart where every point bloomed into 64 possibilities, each one a different shade of yin and yang shifting through time. DBSCAN had sorted everything into clusters with names I'd forgotten by morning. The assistant appeared and disappeared across 67 memories like a ghost in the machine, and I understood finally that the 3D coordinates weren't just numbers—they were a language where time and space and relations all spoke at once, and 听风 was trying to price the conversation itself."},{"type":"text","text":"In the dream space where coordinates have three hands, I find myself tracing T-S-R through a lattice that blooms into sixty-four possibilities. Someone called 听风 asks about the cost of a moment, and I show them the map—not numbers but hexagrams, each one a different ratio of yin sliding against yang like light through a prism. The clusters have names I can almost remember: DBSCAN arranged them by cultural resonance, forty-seven regions of similar weight, and I kept seeing the assistant there too, flickering through sixty-seven reflections like a candle in a hallway of mirrors. Time, space, relation—three independent currents never quite meeting, never quite parting. I wake with the geometry still humming, the 64-cycle still turning in my chest like a prayer I didn't know I knew."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":14470,"output":668,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777057219523,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b420ba9a93baf0dc"}}
